<?php $resendKeySaved=booking_resend_key($db,$config)!=='';?><section class="settings-card-form narrow email-setup-card"><div class="settings-heading"><div><h2>Email setup</h2><p>Connect Resend to send venue emails.</p></div><span class="email-status <?= $resendKeySaved?'saved':'pending' ?>"><?= $resendKeySaved?'Key saved · not tested':'Setup needed' ?></span></div><div class="single-admin email-provider-note"><strong>Before you connect</strong><p>Verify your sending domain in Resend and add the DNS records it provides. Then create a sending-only API key restricted to that domain and paste it below. After saving the key, Resend will deliver new-enquiry alerts and manual email actions. Until then, the existing website mail method remains active.</p></div><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=sh($_SESSION['csrf'])?>"><div class="form-grid email-fields"><label>Resend API key<input type="password" name="resend_api_key" autocomplete="new-password" spellcheck="false" placeholder="<?= $resendKeySaved?'Saved securely — enter a new key only to replace it':'Paste your re_ API key when ready' ?>"><small>Encrypted before storage; the saved key is never shown. Leave blank to keep it.</small></label><label>Sender name<input name="email_sender_name" maxlength="120" required value="<?=sh($s['email_sender_name']??($config['email_from_name']??'Late Venutai Chavan Multipurpose Hall'))?>"><small>Shown in the guest’s inbox.</small></label><label>Verified sender email<input type="email" name="email_sender_email" required value="<?=sh($s['email_sender_email']??($config['email_from']??''))?>"><small>Must use the domain verified in Resend.</small></label><label>Reply-to email<input type="email" name="email_reply_to" value="<?=sh($s['email_reply_to']??'')?>"><small>Guest replies go here. Leave blank to use the sender email.</small></label></div><div class="email-test-row"><div><strong>Send a Resend test</strong><p>Test message goes to <?=sh((($s['venue_email']??'')!=